            "enable_image": false,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/free-carpet-samples-home-page_2.jpg",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<div style=\"background-color:#414b52; color:white; margin-bottom:20px;\" class=\"welcome-online-carpet\">\n    <h1>Welcome to Wilsons Beds</h1>\n\n    <p>\n        Great sleep starts with the right bed. At Wilsons Beds, we offer a huge choice of quality beds, mattresses and headboards at fantastic prices, all backed by the friendly service you’d expect from the Wilsons family.\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n        We’re part of the family-owned Wilsons Carpets business, which has been serving homes across the region for over 50 years. Our Price Promise means you can shop with confidence, knowing you’ll always get a great deal on your new bed, mattress or headboard.\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n        You can try our range for yourself at one of our four large bed showrooms, with a selection of beds and mattresses also available at many of our other Wilsons stores. Visit our <u><a href=\"/pages/stores\">Stores</a></u> page to find your nearest Wilsons Beds showroom.\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n        Want to know more about us? Visit our <u><a href=\"/pages/about-us\">About Us</a></u> page.\n    </p>\n</div>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
